          <span style="font-family:'Press Start 2P','Galmuri11',monospace;font-size:10px;color:#a481d1">02 ONLINE</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:28px">
          <a href="https://eventhub.byeolter.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:block;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;background:#0e1030;border:3px solid #000;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #39265d,8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.5);transition:transform .12s steps(2),box-shadow .12s steps(2)" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-6px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 0 0 4px #ff6b5e,0 0 26px rgba(255,107,94,.42),12px 12px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.55)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='';this.style.boxShadow='0 0 0 4px #39265d,8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.5)'">
            <div style="background:#ff6b5e;border-bottom:3px solid #000;padding:10px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px"><span style="font-family:'Press Start 2P','Galmuri11',monospace;font-size:9px;color:#0a0a1f">WEB 01</span><span style="font-family:'Press Start 2P','Galmuri11',monospace;font-size:9px;color:#0a0a1f">LIVE</span></div>
            <img src="/assets/eventhub-og.png" alt="EventHub Live 실시간 Q&A 서비스 미리보기" style="display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.9;object-fit:cover;border-bottom:3px solid #000">
            <div style="padding:20px 20px 22px"><h2 style="font-family:'Press Start 2P','Galmuri11',monospace;font-size:clamp(14px,2.4vw,19px);line-height:1.4;color:#ffd23f;text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #ff5db1;margin:0">EVENTHUB LIVE</h2><p style="font-size:clamp(18px,2.2vw,22px);line-height:1.4;color:#cdd6ff;margin:12px 0 0">강연과 모임을 위한 실시간 Q&amp;A, 공지, 참여자 소통 공간.</p><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-top:20px;font-family:'Press Start 2P','Galmuri11',monospace;font-size:9px;color:#ff6b5e;border:2px solid #39265d;padding:11px 14px;letter-spacing:1px">OPEN EVENTHUB ↗</span></div>
          </a>
          <a href="https://ohaengsai.byeolter.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:block;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;background:#0e1030;border:3px solid #000;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #39265d,8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.5);transition:transform .12s steps(2),box-shadow .12s steps(2)" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-6px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 0 0 4px #3b82f6,0 0 26px rgba(59,130,246,.42),12px 12px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.55)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='';this.style.boxShadow='0 0 0 4px #39265d,8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.5)'">
            <div style="background:#2563eb;border-bottom:3px solid #000;padding:10px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px"><span style="font-family:'Press Start 2P','Galmuri11',monospace;font-size:9px;color:#fff">WEB 02</span><span style="font-family:'Press Start 2P','Galmuri11',monospace;font-size:9px;color:#fff">LIVE</span></div>
            <img src="/assets/ohaengsai-og.png" alt="오행사이 팀 궁합 서비스 미리보기" style="display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.9;object-fit:cover;border-bottom:3px solid #000">
            <div style="padding:20px 20px 22px"><h2 style="font-family:'Press Start 2P','Galmuri11',monospace;font-size:clamp(14px,2.4vw,19px);line-height:1.4;color:#ffd23f;text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #ff5db1;margin:0">OHAENGSAI</h2><p style="font-size:clamp(18px,2.2vw,22px);line-height:1.4;color:#cdd6ff;margin:12px 0 0">생년월일과 출생지로 팀의 사주·오행 흐름과 궁합을 살펴보는 서비스.</p><span style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-top:20px;font-family:'Press Start 2P','Galmuri11',monospace;font-size:9px;color:#5da0ff;border:2px solid #39265d;padding:11px 14px;letter-spacing:1px">OPEN OHAENGSAI ↗</span></div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <footer style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;padding:18px clamp(16px,4vw,40px);border-top:3px solid #000;background:#0d0d28;font-family:'Press Start 2P','Galmuri11',monospace;font-size:8px;color:#6a73b8"><span style="color:#ffd23f">© 2026 BYEOLTER</span><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:24px"><a href="/privacy/" style="color:#4fe0d8;text-decoration:none">PRIVACY</a><a href="https://github.com/Byeolter" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#cdd6ff;text-decoration:none">GITHUB</a></div></footer>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
(function(){const sky=document.getElementById('sky');for(let i=0;i<70;i++){const d=document.createElement('div');const size=Math.random()<.7?2:3;d.style.cssText=`position:absolute;left:${(Math.random()*100).toFixed(2)}%;top:${(Math.random()*100).toFixed(2)}%;width:${size}px;height:${size}px;background:#b88cff;animation:twpix ${(1.4+Math.random()*2).toFixed(2)}s steps(2) ${(Math.random()*3).toFixed(2)}s infinite`;sky.appendChild(d)}})();
document.getElementById('btn-menu').addEventListener('click',()=>{const m=document.getElementById('mobile-menu');m.style.display=m.style.display==='flex'?'none':'flex'});
</script>
</body>
</html>
